<section class="cc-name">
  <div class="cc-name-inner">
    <div class="cc-eyebrow cc-eyebrow--center">Don't let the name fool you</div>

    <p class="cc-name-quote" style="margin-top: var(--sp-7);">
      The name <em>certification course</em> can be misleading. Yes — it
      leads to the certificate, to opening your own practice, to weaving
      Somatic Vocal Healing into the work you already do. But that is only
      part of it. At heart, this is a deepening trajectory. A path that
      takes you further into the work than anything else we offer — because
      every session, if you join, is held live, with us in the room together.
    </p>
    <div class="cc-name-by">— Jacob</div>

    <p class="cc-name-tag">
      <strong>This course has a dual purpose.</strong> First, it is about you.
      Second, about your capacity to guide, facilitate, and hold space for
      others. Everything you learn to do for someone else can perfectly be
      applied to yourself.
    </p>
